            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Aoyama",
            "review_text": "TravelingFoodie\nMiami, Florida10830 contributions\n0\nExcellent\nDec 2025 • Friends\nWe returned to Aoyama Japanese Izakaya for dinner after about a year and were very happy to see that the quality remains excellent. The atmosphere is authentic and comfortable, with a genuine izakaya vibe that makes the evening feel relaxed and enjoyable. The food was consistently very good, well prepared, and full of flavour, clearly made with care and good ingredients. Service was attentive, professional, and well paced. Overall, a top-quality Japanese dining experience in Saigon and a place we would happily return to again.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
