            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Aoyama",
            "review_text": "TravelingFoodie\nMiami, Florida10830 contributions\n0\nSuperb stuff\nDec 2024 • Friends\nWe were craving a luxurious lunch featuring uni, toro, otoro, and wagyu, and were delighted to find a highly-rated restaurant near our hotel. Opting for their omakase menu turned out to be an exceptional choice—it exceeded our expectations in every way.\n\nThe selection was larger than we anticipated, and every dish was a masterpiece of flavor and presentation. The quality of the ingredients and the chef’s artistry truly stood out.\n\nWe left more than satisfied and would highly recommend this restaurant for anyone seeking an outstanding omakase experience.\nRead more\nWritten December 30, 2024",
